<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00682">
	<title>Highway Auto Speed Change</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_CT25Z022_E.eps" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2">
							<ol outputclass="callout">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Driver Assistance</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Driving Convenience</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol>Auto motorway Speed Change</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>With the vehicle is in <term translate="no">DRIVE READY</term>, select <menucascade><uicontrol>Settings</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>Auto Highway Speed Change</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system.</p>
		<note type="note">
			<p>When there is a problem with Navigation-based Smart Cruise Control, the function cannot be set from the Settings menu.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
</concept>